# Do not perform any line ending conversions.
# This repo primarily uses CRLF (Windows-style) line endings, as it is a
# Visual Studio / .NET project, but some files use LF. By setting -text,
# git will leave all files exactly as-is on both commit and checkout,
# regardless of any global core.autocrlf or core.eol settings on a
# contributor's machine.
* -text

# The Migrator tool's published output is self-contained (bundles the full
# .NET runtime into a single file per platform), so each one is tens of MB.
# Tracked via Git LFS rather than as a regular blob, so repo history doesn't
# grow by ~150MB every time this tool gets republished.
Tools/Eii.Ecopath.Storage.Migrator/Publish/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# EwEImportHelper's published output is a normal (non-self-contained) net48 build, not single-file -
# but it still includes EwECore.dll itself (6+ MB) among its dependencies. Tracked via LFS for the
# same reason as Migrator above: repeated republishes of a multi-MB binary would otherwise
# accumulate meaningfully in repo history over time, even though no single file here is "huge".
Tools/EwEImportHelper/Publish/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text